e issue other  than when Cam Newton's shoulder really  started to kind of take a turn for the  worse and the offensive line got pretty  banged up but they see the caliber of  talent on defense and they see Ron  Rivera at the defensive minded head  coach and I think there were really high  expectations especially after that  Baltimore win that Cincinnati went and  that Philadelphia comeback when I think  people really had a lot higher  expectations and there seems to be a  little bit of shock throughout the  locker room right now because these guys  really expected those things of  themselves as well and they just they've  kind of been searching for answers all  season so I guess it is fitting that the  Cam Newton the guy who makes this team  go is also searching for answers  great stuff Jordan we appreciate your  time good luck the rest of the season  thanks guys appreciate you that's Jordan  Rodrigue  who covers Carolina Panthers Charlotte  Observer forum or Dan Patrick show to  the audience channel 239 on DirecTV or  download the Dan Patrick show app  [Music]
 

